        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Dancers ages 11–25 are invited to audition in San Francisco for our 2026 Summer Program, hosted right here in our city!—a rigorous, collaborative dance experience that values risk-taking, creative power, and independent thinking."
      }
    ],
